1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Welcome. Today we compare three practical topics in a short workshop.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:29,000
First, garden soil needs drainage. Add compost and check how much water the soil retains.

3
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:48,000
For healthy tomato seedlings, keep the potting mix moist and give roots enough space.

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Next, make a monthly budget. List rent, groceries, and other recurring expenses.

5
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Set a savings target and compare planned spending with your actual transactions.

6
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:19,000
Finally, camera lens selection. A wide angle lens captures more of a landscape.

7
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:38,000
A telephoto lens narrows the field of view and brings distant subjects closer.
